    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Glowing Bones"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "An iridescent animal emits phosphorescent bright light in a 15-foot aura.\n\nThe animal can suppress this display until the end of its next turn as a single action, which has the concentrate trait. The color of the light is determined by the iridescent animal's creator."
            },
            "id": "9cde5364-f5c0-4a56-b541-98fdc809d969",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:13.536631"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Color Splash"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(visual)\n\nWhen the iridescent elephant stomps its foot, a bright, disorienting burst of light pulses through its leg. Each creatures adjacent to the iridescent elephant when it makes a foot Strike (regardless of whether or not it hit) must succeed at a 24 Will save or be flat-footed until the beginning of the elephant's next turn."
            },
            "id": "d6766022-9cab-44e7-8e54-6049422b0a34",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:13.536631"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Grabbing Trunk"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A Medium or smaller creature hit by the elephant's trunk is grabbed. If the elephant moves, it can bring the grabbed creature along with it."
            },
            "id": "4c3b50a5-c18f-41af-a8a1-f0edba81255f",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:13.536631"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Trunk Beam"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(light, visual)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe iridescent elephant blasts a beam of light from its trunk in a 30-foot line. Each creature in the area must attempt a 22 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded permanently."
            },
            "id": "2826b852-1ec8-460a-848a-15a3d544d194",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:13.536631"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
